      "content": "the way you put it... final stillness. it's the only thing that sounds peaceful. it feels like i'm just tired of breathing the same air as people who would step on me just to get ahead. if there's no real change possible, then why keep forcing myself through every day? it just feels like a slow, painful defeat. is it really so wrong to just want it to be over?",
